istics of transparency, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it; Public Policy and Governance', 'Active'), ('KCR_001206', 'participation', 'Social Science', 'Public Policy and Governance', 'Policy / Governance Concept', 'Involvement of affected people or stakeholders in public decision-making and policy processes.', 'Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of participation within Public Policy and Governance, particularly where the Governance and Regulation module establishes its technical context.', 'Core considerations include the defining characteristics of participation, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'Involvement of affected people or stakeholders in public decision-making and policy processes. Within Governance and Regulation, the concept covers Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of participation within Public Policy and Governance, particularly where the Governance and Regulation module establishes its technical context. Key technical considerations are Core considerations include the defining characteristics of participation, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'participation; Core considerations include the defining characteristics of participation, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it; Public Policy and Governance', 'Active'), ('KCR_001207', 'regulatory design', 'Social Science', 'Public Policy and Governance', 'Policy / Governance Concept', 'Designing rules, standards, enforcement mechanisms, and institutional arrangements to achieve specified public objectives while considering compliance and implementation co